00:04:53.126 --> 00:04:55.928
Ayo, minum sampai habis.

00:05:01.134 --> 00:05:07.106
Terima kasih. Mama lagi apa?

00:05:11.477 --> 00:05:12.845
Ena, kau sudah pulang?

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.181
Iya, aku pulang.

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:23.323
Selamat datang, Ena. Tadi sedang ritual pembersihan, ya?

00:05:23.456 --> 00:05:25.725
